1
00:03:44,444 --> 00:03:50,444
Be there and be square.

2
00:07:28,888 --> 00:07:34,888
A Minecraft Movie is a family, fantasy, comedy film directed by Jared Hess.

3
00:11:13,333 --> 00:11:19,333
Four misfits find themselves struggling with ordinary problems when they are suddenly pulled through a
mysterious portal into the Overworld: a bizarre, cubic wonderland that thrives on imagination.

4
00:14:57,777 --> 00:15:03,777
To get back home, they'll have to master this world while embarking on a
magical quest with an unexpected, expert crafter, Steve.

5
00:18:42,222 --> 00:18:48,222
Garrett, played by Jason Momoa.

6
00:22:26,666 --> 00:22:32,666
Steve, played by Jack Black.

7
00:26:11,111 --> 00:26:17,111
Henry, played by Sebastian Eugene Hansen.

8
00:29:55,555 --> 00:30:01,555
Natalie, played by Emma Myers.

9
00:33:40,000 --> 00:33:46,000
Dawn, played by Danielle Brooks.

10
00:37:24,444 --> 00:37:30,444
Vice Principal Marlene, played by Jennifer Coolidge.

11
00:41:08,888 --> 00:41:14,888
A Minecraft Movie is a 2025 fantasy adventure film based on the 2011 video
game Minecraft developed and published by Mojang Studios.

12
00:44:53,333 --> 00:44:59,333
It was directed by Jared Hess from a screenplay Chris Bowman, Hubbel Palmer, Neil Widener, Gavin
James, and Chris Galletta, based on a story by Allison Schroeder, Bowman, and Palmer.

13
00:48:37,777 --> 00:48:43,777
The film stars Jason Momoa, Jack Black, Emma Myers, Danielle
Brooks, Sebastian Hansen, and Jennifer Coolidge.

14
00:52:22,222 --> 00:52:28,222
It follows four misfits from the fictional town of Chuglass, Idaho, that are pulled through a portal into a cubic
world, and must embark on a quest back to the real world with the help of a "crafter" named Steve.

15
00:56:06,666 --> 00:56:12,666
Plans for a Minecraft film adaptation originated in 2014, when game creator Markus
Persson revealed that Mojang Studios was in talks with Warner Bros.

16
00:59:51,111 --> 00:59:57,111
Pictures to develop the project.

17
01:03:35,555 --> 01:03:41,555
Throughout its development, the film shifted between
several directors, producers, and story drafts.

18
01:07:20,000 --> 01:07:26,000
By 2022, Legendary Entertainment became involved, and Hess was
hired as director with Momoa in talks to star.

19
01:11:04,444 --> 01:11:10,444
Further casting took place from May 2023 to January 2024.

20
01:14:48,888 --> 01:14:54,888
Principal photography began later that month in New
Zealand and concluded in April 2024.

21
01:18:33,333 --> 01:18:39,333
Mark Mothersbaugh composed the score, and Sony Pictures Imageworks, Wētā
FX, and Digital Domain provided the film's visual effects.

22
01:22:17,777 --> 01:22:23,777
A Minecraft Movie had its premiere at the Empire, Leicester Square in London on March
30, 2025, and was released in the United States and Sweden on April 4.

23
01:26:02,222 --> 01:26:08,222
The film received mixed reviews from critics, and was a box-office success, grossing $958 million against a budget of $150
million, becoming the fifth-highest-grossing film of 2025 and the second-highest-grossing video game film of all time.

24
01:29:46,666 --> 01:29:52,666
A sequel is scheduled for release on July 23, 2027.

25
01:33:31,111 --> 01:33:37,111
The film explores themes of friendship, surrealism, exploration, portal, miner.

26
01:37:15,555 --> 01:37:21,555
The tone is lighthearted and mind_bending.
